  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Haap Liep Klaip VA utv&#xe4;rd</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haap Liep Klaip W&amp;WW eval - Eval Env. Projects W&amp;WW</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy services for the evaluation of environmental projects in Haapsalu in Estonia, Liepaja ibn Latvia and Klaipeda in Lthuania. The aim of the evaluation is to highlight the results obtained through the Swedish support in the project. Swedish counterpart is Technopolis, and the Sida-support amounts to SEK 950 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering av investeringar i avloppsrening i Estland, Lettland och Litauen. Utv&#xe4;rderingen ska belysa de resultat som erh&#xe5;llits genom svenskt st&#xf6;d, och fokusera p&#xe5; de komponenter Sida finansierar. Svensk genomf&#xf6;rande part &#xe4;r Technopolis, och st&#xf6;det omfattar h&#xf6;gst SEK 950 000.</narrative>
  </description>
